title: Any subscriber hides for *all* its author's subscribers
pid: 1b6b1aa8-e860-40a8-a61c-6d6bd21d251b
body: |2-
  If any of an author's atoms -- say, atom A --
  hides atom H from subscriptions,
  the hide applies to all of that author's subscriptions,
  not just A's subscriptions.

  If an author's atoms A and B
  can both reach X and Y from their subscription,
  A can hide X for both of them,
  while B hides Y for both of them.
